  {
    "id": 3007002020010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ねぇねぇ、さくやんって身長いくつ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700202/3007002020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002020020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね……\r\n以前測った時は、たしか175センチだったかな",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700202/3007002020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "わぁほんとにー！？\r\nいいよなぁさくやん！　スラっとしててかっこいいしさ～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700202/3007002020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この身長があるからこそ、まさしく王子！\r\nって感じでしょー？　うらやましい～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700202/3007002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002020050,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "結華ちゃんは……\r\n王子様になりたいの……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700202/3007002020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうだよー？　だってそしたらさぁ",
